          "type": "_faq-row",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Q1.  What is Trustpilot, and how is it different from other review platforms?",
            "answer": "<p>It's the most-cited review platform in AI search — 58% in ChatGPT, 52% in Perplexity. More coverage, more trust.</p>",
